    action: "Get one FHA and one conventional loan estimate on the same day and compare the all-in monthly payment including mortgage insurance, then the total cost at years three, seven and ten, noting when conventional insurance can be cancelled and whether FHA's cannot. Pick the cheaper loan over your realistic holding period, and put down more than the minimum if it takes you off the highest-default tier.",
