    action: "If family can help, ask early and specifically — an amount, a date, and whether it is a gift or a loan — and get the lender's gift-letter requirements before the money moves. Keep contributing your own savings so you hold real equity at closing, and if help comes from siblings or grandparents, tell everyone involved to avoid later resentment.",
