    action: "Give the move a budget line for the first three months — not just boxes but time off, meals and childcare — and decide in advance how you will rebuild the social layer: the first neighbor you will invite over, the club or congregation you will join, the school contact you will make. Do not schedule any other major life change within sixty days of closing.",
